WEBVTT

00:11:27.145 --> 00:11:31.246
And they're dealt with with creativity.

00:11:31.553 --> 00:11:36.593
The greatest force, through time,

00:11:36.617 --> 00:11:40.450
is inventiveness, human inventiveness,

00:11:40.474 --> 00:11:41.918
adaptability.

00:11:42.268 --> 00:11:45.625
So you're going to see
these restructurings happen,

00:11:45.649 --> 00:11:48.197
and you're going to see
the kind of inventiveness

00:11:48.221 --> 00:11:50.950
that you just saw from Marko, OK?

00:11:50.974 --> 00:11:55.591
And it's the power of that adaptation
that is the greatest power.

00:11:55.615 --> 00:11:57.072
I did a study,

00:11:57.096 --> 00:11:59.428
which is on LinkedIn
if anyone wants to see it,

00:11:59.452 --> 00:12:02.853
and it goes back 500 years.